        </p>

        <h2>8. Advertising</h2>
        <p>
          The App may display advertisements served by us or by third-party advertising partners. By
          using the App, you consent to the display of such advertisements. We are not responsible for
          the content of third-party advertisements or the products and services they promote.
        </p>

        <h2>9. In-App Purchases and Subscriptions</h2>
        <p>
          Certain features of the App may be available through paid subscriptions or in-app purchases
          processed via the Apple App Store or Google Play Store. All purchases are subject to the
