          date at the top of this page. Continued use of the App after any changes constitutes your
          acceptance of the revised Terms. We encourage you to review these Terms periodically.
        </p>

        <h2>16. Contact Us</h2>
        <p>If you have questions or concerns about these Terms, please contact us at:</p>
        <address>
          <strong>SHEMED YISRAEL SOFTWARE CREATION LLC</strong><br />
          4851 W Hillsboro Blvd Ste A3<br />
          Pompano Beach, FL 33073<br />
          United States<br />
          Email: <a href="mailto:administracion@shemayisraelsrl.com">administracion@shemayisraelsrl.com</a>
        </address>

      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer playStoreUrl="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.topoquizz" />
</Layout>

<style>
  .privacy-page {
    min-height: 100vh;
  }

  .privacy-hero {
    background: linear-gradient(121deg, #3b4d6d 0%, var(--blue) 60%, var(--blue-mid) 100%);
    padding: 72px 0 64px;
  }

  .privacy-hero-inner {
    max-width: 860px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 80px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .privacy-hero h1 {
    font-family: "Plus Jakarta Sans", sans-serif;
    font-size: 48px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--white);
    line-height: 1.15;
  }

  .privacy-hero p {
    color: var(--blue-light);
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .privacy-body {
    padding: 64px 0 96px;
    background: var(--bg);
  }

  .privacy-content {
    max-width: 860px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 80px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .privacy-content p {
    color: var(--teal);
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .privacy-content h2 {
    font-family: "Plus Jakarta Sans", sans-serif;
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--navy);
    margin-top: 20px;
    padding-bottom: 10px;
    border-bottom: 1.5px solid var(--blue-pale);
  }

  .privacy-content h3 {
    font-family: "Plus Jakarta Sans", sans-serif;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--navy);
    margin-top: 4px;
  }

  .privacy-content ul {
    padding-left: 20px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  .privacy-content li {
    color: var(--teal);
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .privacy-content a {
    color: var(--blue);
    text-decoration: underline;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }

  .privacy-content a:hover {
    color: var(--navy);
  }

  .privacy-content strong {
    color: var(--navy);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  address {
    font-style: normal;
    background: var(--white);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 24px 28px;
    color: var(--teal);
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 2;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(40, 49, 67, 0.05);
  }

  address strong {
    display: block;
    font-family: "Plus Jakarta Sans", sans-serif;
    font-size: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .privacy-hero-inner,
    .privacy-content {
      padding: 0 20px;
    }

    .privacy-hero {
      padding: 48px 0 40px;
    }

    .privacy-hero h1 {
      font-size: 32px;
    }

    .privacy-body {
      padding: 48px 0 72px;
    }
  }
</style>
